{"product":{"id":6236625141948,"title":"Cortech Endurance X‑Series Laminate Table with X‑Base","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eCortech Endurance X Series Tables, like the rest of Cortech's Endurance Series Furniture line, are ideal for continuous use in extreme environments, including compassionate and normative Behavioral Health Care Facilities, Residential Treatment Centers and Facilities, Hospital Psychiatric Units, Correctional Institutions, Mental Health Treatment Centers and other medical and public safety facilities that require the ultimate combination of durability and functional design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEndurance X-Base Tables offer a robust and reliable solution for high traffic dining and recreation areas. By design, the X-Base is capable of enduring hefty load capacities without concern of tipping over. They can be ballasted with additional weight or bolted to the floor depending on the level of security required. Cortech's Endurance X Series Tables have an extreme load capacity due to its rotational molding technology and the rounded table top edge increases safety and comfort, making them ideal for use as Dayroom\/Dining table applications.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTable top sizes: 36\" and 42\" square, 42\" and 48\" round\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSturdy X-Base design helps keep chairs and users separated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLaminate Top is seamless one-piece design with extreme strength and impact resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYour choice of models:\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e36SVPX - 36\"x36\" Square, Vinyl Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e36SDPX - 36\"x36\" Square, Dura-Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e36SVGX - 36\"x36\" Square, Vinyl Edge, Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e36SDGX - 36\"x36\" Square, Dura-Edge, Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e42RVPX - 42\" Round, Vinyl Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e42RDPX - 42\" Round, Dura-Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e42SVPX - 42\"x42\" Square, Vinyl Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e42SDPX - 42\"x42\" Square, Dura-Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e42SVGX - 42\"x42\" Square, Vinyl Edge, Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e42SDGX - 42\"x42\" Square, Dura-Edge, Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e48RVPX - 48\" Round, Vinyl Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e48RDPX - 48\" Round, Dura-Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e48RVGX - 48\" Round, Vinyl Edge, Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e48RDGX - 48\" Round, Dura-Edge, Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpecify leg bottom: _G Floor Glide or _B Bolt Down (can be bolted to the floor via concealed pilot holes with exclusive Sabre Mount System).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColors: X-Base is black. Plain table tops are gray. Game tops are white.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCan be bolted to the floor via concealed pilot holes with exclusive Sabre Mount System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe legs fastened to the table top with tamper resistant screws with metal to metal connection for added strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy to clean and maintain\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10 Year Warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstructed of high impact polyethylene in a durable, one piece, rotationally molded design for increased strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufactured to ISO Quality Standards in the USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStain resistant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLegs can be easily filled with sand to weigh down\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlame Retardant (passes Cal 133) - test reports available upon request\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Cortech Endurance Furniture:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Cortech Endurance intense use furniture line is ideal for use as behavioral health furniture, correctional facility furniture, detention furniture, and Behavioral Healthcare mental health furniture. The Endurance Furniture Series is also a perfect fit for residential institutions, public safety facilities, detention centers, correctional institutions, prisons and any intense or high abuse applications such as drug and alcohol rehabilitation centers and addiction treatment centers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Cortech USA:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCortech USA (Correctional Technologies) manufactures products that are exceptionally durable, designed for use in compassionate and normative behavioral healthcare, corrections, law enforcement, heavy use commercial and industrial environments, parks and recreation, schools, universities, hospitals, emergency and homeless shelters, and other institutions and facilities where safety and durability matter. Cortech products are ideal for extreme use and intensive use environments.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Cortech","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-01-29T16:07:34-05:00","handle":"cortech-endurance-x-series-laminate-table-w-xbase","updated_at":"2026-11-11T13:06:18-05:00","published_at":"2021-01-29T16:07:34-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Behavioral Healthcare Furniture, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-activity-rooms, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-dining-areas, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-group-dayrooms, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-staff-room, cd-furn-cafeteria, cd-furn-dayroom, cd-furn-staff-room, cd-furn-visitation, cortech-endurance, cortech-usa, Prison-Furniture","variants":[{"id":37962688495804,"product_id":6236625141948,"title":"36SVPX - 36x36 Square, Plain, Vinyl Edge","price":"1560.00","sku":"C601634-01","position":1,"compare_at_price":"1950.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"36SVPX - 